{"beat_id": "S011_B109", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "Also yes.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "B011 — WHAT THEY ACTUALLY KNOW", "staging": "Maevra:", "staging_after": "Cyanis looks pleased with this development."}},
{"beat_id": "S011_B110", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Harth.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "B012 — LEAVING", "staging": "Late afternoon.\n\nThe party leaves Wayfinder Junction.\n\nNo final encounter.\n\nNo antagonist watching.\n\nNo collapse behind them.\n\nNo giant reveal.\n\nTorren stops briefly and looks back at the crossroads.\n\nThen at one of the copied map sections.\n\nHe adjusts its orientation.\n\nPuts it away.\n\nCyanis waits a few steps ahead."}},
